# Yeah, yeah,


01:20:37.900 --> 01:20:39.600
# Wake me up, baby,


01:20:39.700 --> 01:20:42.200
# Wake me up in my soul,


01:20:46.100 --> 01:20:48.200
# Wake me up baby,


01:20:48.300 --> 01:20:51.200
# I feel my heart's getting cold,


01:20:51.300 --> 01:20:52.300
# I don't wanna get cold,


01:20:52.300 --> 01:20:53.300
# Now, warm me up,


